{"chapter-slug":"rw8-25 KH","paragraph":720,"wording":"[Storm Bandits]","event":"named","holder-slug":"yvlon-byres","holder-quote":"To Yvlon’s surprise, once she’d arrived in the cells, she and the other [Storm Bandits] had been divided up. Their shackles had been removed, and they had been fed, even given fresh clothing, albeit already used. The [Guards] watched them, but didn’t offer to beat them and gave them privacy, even small luxuries.","id":"be4566f9-d32e-54a9-89ac-58eb5902120c"}
